{"id":"eb8ec521f1c6bc18","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md","title":"公理去引号与固定点透明性的条件式","display":"thm-T-schema-partial-recovery — 公理去引号与固定点透明性的条件式","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery","aliases":["91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery","91-thm-T-schema-recovery","91-thm-partial-T-schema"],"display":"thm-T-schema-partial-recovery — 公理去引号与固定点透明性的条件式","depends_on":["[[91-thm-compositional-completeness]]","[[91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","[[91-df-jump-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery</span><span>91-thm-T-schema-recovery</span><span>91-thm-partial-T-schema</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-T-schema-partial-recovery — 公理去引号与固定点透明性的条件式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73ccb673e6681e3d\" href=\"?note=73ccb673e6681e3d\" title=\"91-thm-compositional-completeness\">91-thm-compositional-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b0e2f74fa0a4326a\" href=\"?note=b0e2f74fa0a4326a\" title=\"91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity\">91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> (含真理谓词的公理理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompAdeq}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\subseteq\\mathcal S\">\\(\\operatorname{CompAdeq}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\subseteq\\mathcal S\\)</span>\n(<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 含基础原子与组合真理公理)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (基础语言句子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> (一致强 Kleene 固定点)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (固定点评价)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recovery}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CompAdeq}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recovery}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CompAdeq}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}))=v_\\Gamma(\\psi)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}))=v_\\Gamma(\\psi)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式是证明论结论，来自对基础句的结构归纳。第二式是语义固定点条件；\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 为 gap，两边同取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span>，相应强 Kleene 双条件也取\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span> 而不是指定真值。</p>\n<p>因此不能对任意未说明公理的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\)</span> 断言两类“恢复”，也不能把\n语义同值直接提升为理论可证 T-schema。TB、UTB、组合理论、KF 与 VF\n各自需要独立指定实例域、双条件语义和内部确定性表达。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-compositional-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"73ccb673e6681e3d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-compositional-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity","status":"resolved","id":"b0e2f74fa0a4326a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CompAdeq}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\subseteq\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recovery}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CompAdeq}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right],","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}))=v_\\Gamma(\\psi)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T","display":false}],"bytes":1998,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-cons